<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Scott Corp half year profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Scott Corp half year profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     4.73 vs 5.71</p>
<p>    Net					2.80 vs 3.58</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     6.0  vs 6.0</p>
<p>Note: Scott Corp Ltd is a transport company.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  141.46 vs 125.31</p>
<p>    Other income			   7.72 vs 2.03</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.4  vs 12.0</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		 loss  0.40 vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 24</p>
<p>Reg date April 11</p>
<p>    Tax					1.53 vs 2.13</p>
<p>    Interest				 1.06 vs 1.00</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   3.09 vs 3.29</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
